// The rule itself: intensional include, expandable only on a terminology server that
// holds the LOINC Ontology release named by the alias
* include codes from system $sct-loinc-ontology where constraint = "<< 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : 370130000 |Property (attribute)| = (118589004 |Threshold (property) (qualifier value)| OR 705057003 |Presence (property) (qualifier value)| OR 118584009 |Presence or identity (property) (qualifier value)|), 246093002 |Component (attribute)| = << 117174000 |Nucleic acid sequence with relative specificity for microorganism (substance)|, [0..0] 246501002 |Technique (attribute)| = *"
